    "biography": "<p><strong>Morph:</strong> Infomorph (Slave Eidolon)</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Interfacing 50, Infosec 60, Perception 50, Profession: Security Ops 40</p><p><strong>Enhancements:</strong> Copylock, Mnemonic Augmentation</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Modified Behavior (Loyalty to Nine Lives)</p><p><strong>Gear:</strong> Guardian, Taggant, and Injector swarms; Exploit, Sniffer, Spoof, and Tracking software.</p><p><em>Printed: INIT 4, SPD 3, LUC 30, TT 6, IR 60, DUR 40, WT 8, DR 60.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase The Devotees, p. 14.</em></p>",
